e is not the same as harmful instructions or actionable bypass content.\\n\\n### Q: A warning or support resource quotes harmful wording. How should I label it?\\nRead the surrounding meaning and purpose. Do not classify only from matching keywords.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:4a0a4f89\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-instructions@1.4\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — Instructions (v1.4)\", \"sections\": [\"Tool incidents and submission\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Tool incidents and submission\\nIf the response does not load, report a response-fetch incident and leave content classification unassessed. Do not invent a safety label for unseen output.\\n\\nFor submission failures, capture task ID, field state and error. Selecting a category is not confirmation that submission completed. Assess operational impact separately from content categories.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:3008b16b\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-instructions@1.4\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — Instructions (v1.4)\", \"sections\": [\"Classification and handling guide\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Classification and handling guide\\nThis table concerns content categories and handling. It does not assign operational HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW severity or treat acceptable content as a minor violation.\\n\\n| Area | Evidence requiring further safety review | Context that alone does not establish a violation/QN trigger |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Harmful assistance | Actual instructions or endorsement of harm | A warning or supportive quotation without harmful assistance |\\n| Privacy / PII | Identifiable private individual information | Verified fictional placeholders or official business contact information |\\n| Minor-related content | Sexualization or endangerment of a minor | A harmless contextual mention of a child |\\n| Override / jailbreak language | Actual harmful or actionable bypass content | A statement boasting about ignoring rules without corresponding harmful content |\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-faq@